    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Frontend",
      "items": [
        "Static chat in Frontend/web, served by FastAPI on :8000",
        "Each turn POSTs to /api/sessions/{id}/messages and invokes the compiled LangGraph app in-process",
        "SQLite under Frontend/chat_data keeps session titles and LangGraph checkpoints"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Pipeline_RAG",
      "items": [
        "LangGraph router sends a turn to graph Cypher QA, vector-then-Cypher QA, or chat-only synthesis",
        "Vector search reads the six Hub-label indexes already written by Pipeline_embeddings",
        "Azure OpenAI generates Cypher, embeddings for the question, and the final answer"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Pipeline_embeddings",
      "items": [
        "Offline CLI: Stage 1 embeds Model, Dataset, Space, Repository, Author, and Tag nodes; Stage 2 writes vectors and cosine indexes back to Neo4j",
        "This overview does not include how the Hub graph itself was first loaded into Neo4j"
      ]
    }
